
<% layout ("layout/boilerplate")%>

<style>
    .terms-page {
    padding: 40px 20px;
    background: #f5f8f5;
    min-height: 100vh;
}

.terms-hero {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto 35px;
    padding: 50px 20px;
    text-align: center;
    color: white;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1b5e20, #43a047);
    border-radius: 20px;
}

.terms-hero h1 {
    font-size: 40px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
}

.terms-hero p {
    font-size: 18px;
}

.terms-content {
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
}

.terms-card {
    background: white;
    padding: 25px;
    border-radius: 15px;
    box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    transition: 0.3s;
}

.terms-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
}

.terms-card h3 {
    color: #1b5e20;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.terms-card p {
    color: #555;
    line-height: 1.7;
}

.terms-footer {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 40px;
}

.terms-footer a {
    color: #1b5e20;
    font-weight: bold;
    text-decoration: none;
}

@media (max-width: 768px) {

    .terms-content {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .terms-hero h1 {
        font-size: 30px;
    }

}
</style>

<div class="terms-page">

    <div class="terms-hero">
        <h1>📜 Terms & Conditions</h1>
        <p>
            Simple guidelines for a safe, enjoyable and responsible
            Maharashtra travel experience.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="terms-content">

        <div class="terms-card">
            <h3>🌄 1. Using Our Platform</h3>
            <p>
                Maharashtra Tourism provides information, travel
                recommendations, maps and tourism-related services.
                By using this platform, you agree to follow these terms.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="terms-card">
            <h3>👤 2. User Account</h3>
            <p>
                Users are responsible for providing accurate information
                while creating an account and for keeping their login
                credentials secure.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="terms-card">
            <h3>🗺️ 3. Travel Information</h3>
            <p>
                Destination information, routes, timings and recommendations
                are provided for general guidance. Actual conditions may
                change due to weather, traffic, government rules or other factors.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="terms-card">
            <h3>🤖 4. AI Recommendations</h3>
            <p>
                AI-generated itineraries and recommendations are intended
                to assist travellers. Users should verify important information
                before making travel decisions.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="terms-card">
            <h3>📍 5. Location & Safety</h3>
            <p>
                Location-based features may be used to provide routes,
                nearby attractions and safety alerts. Users should not rely
                solely on the platform during emergencies.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="terms-card">
            <h3>💳 6. Bookings & Payments</h3>
            <p>
                If third-party booking or payment services are used,
                their respective terms and conditions may also apply.
                Users should review the details before confirming a booking.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="terms-card">
            <h3>🚫 7. Prohibited Activities</h3>
            <p>
                Users must not misuse the platform, submit false information,
                attempt unauthorized access, or use the service for illegal
                activities.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="terms-card">
            <h3>⚠️ 8. Limitation of Responsibility</h3>
            <p>
                We aim to provide accurate and useful information, but we
                cannot guarantee that all information will always be complete,
                current or error-free.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="terms-card">
            <h3>🔄 9. Changes to Terms</h3>
            <p>
                We may update these Terms & Conditions when required.
                Continued use of the platform after changes means that
                you accept the updated terms.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="terms-card">
            <h3>📩 10. Contact Us</h3>
            <p>
                If you have questions regarding these Terms & Conditions,
                please contact us through our Contact Us page.
            </p>
        </div>

    </div>

    <div class="terms-footer">
        <p>🌿 Explore Maharashtra • Travel Responsibly • Create Memories</p>
        <a href="/home">← Back to Home</a>
    </div>

</div>